---
layout: base.njk
title: Research
description: Case studies and methodology notes on quantitative sports analytics — data collection, model validation and predictive pipelines.
permalink: /research/
---
<div class="content">

  <h1 class="page-title">Research</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    How the system works — the architecture, the probability engine, the
    market read and the discipline that holds it all together.
  </p>

  {% set sortedResearch = collections.research %}
  {% if sortedResearch.length > 0 %}
    <div class="post-list">
      {% for post in sortedResearch %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card">
        <div class="post-body">
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span>{{ post.date | dateEN }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="post-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p class="post-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px;">Articles coming soon.</p>
  {% endif %}

</div>
